# 0152 — Tabs

## Mission

Composable tab strip for views, documents, and question groups: roving focus,
manual/automatic activation, badges/status, close + reorder hooks, and narrow
contraction (scroll → overflow → Select). **Panel content stays host-owned** by
tab id (Tabs never stores panel widgets).

## Preserve / migrate / split / delete

| Surface | Fate |
|---------|------|
| `TAB_GAP`, `TabCell`, `lay_out_tabs`, `tab_at_column` | **Preserved** |
| `Tab` / `Tabs` / `TabsState` names | **Preserved** (fields expanded) |
| Paint-only strip without `handle_key` | **Migrated** — full interaction |
| `Tab.active` | **Preserved** as paint fallback when `selected` is `None` |
| `TabsState.{selected,hovered,focused,regions}` | **Preserved** (public) |
| `TabsActivation`, `TabsOrientation`, `TabsPresentation`, `TabStatus`, `TabsOutcome` | **Added** |
| `SegmentedControl` | **Preserved** — mode switch, not multi-panel Tabs |

## Consumer edits

```diff
  let tabs = [
-     Tab { id: "a", label: "A", glyph: None, active: true, enabled: true },
+     Tab::new("a", "A").status(TabStatus::Success).closable(true),
+     // or struct update with badge/status/closable fields
  ];
- let mut state = TabsState { selected: Some("a"), focused: true, ..Default::default() };
+ let mut state = TabsState::new().with_selected("a");
+ state.set_focused(true);
+ // optional: .with_activation(TabsActivation::Manual)
+ // optional: .with_orientation(TabsOrientation::Vertical)

- // host only re-rendered on click hacks
+ match state.handle_key(key, &tabs) {
+     TabsOutcome::SelectionChanged { id } => host.show_panel(id),
+     TabsOutcome::CloseRequested { id } => host.close_panel(id),
+     TabsOutcome::OverflowOpened { overflow_ids } => host.menu(overflow_ids),
+     TabsOutcome::ReorderRequested { from, to } => host.reorder(from, to),
+     _ => {}
+ }
+ // Panel state: host HashMap<Id, PanelState> — not inside TabsState

  Tabs::new(&tabs, &system).gap(1).paint(area, buf, &mut state);
```

### vs SegmentedControl

| | Tabs | SegmentedControl |
|--|------|------------------|
| Content | Separate panels per id | One surface mode |
| Close / dirty | Yes | No |
| Overflow | Scroll / `…` / Select | Priority `…` / collapse |

### Activation

| Mode | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| Automatic (default) | Arrow focus also selects |
| Manual | Arrows focus; Enter/click select |

### Narrow

| Width | Presentation |
|-------|----------------|
| Fits all | Expanded |
| Wide but overflow | Scrolling |
| Medium | Overflow `…` |
| Very narrow multi-tab | Select trigger |

### Stories

- `tabs/status`, `tabs/narrow`, `tabs/unicode` (migrated)
- `tabs/overflow`, `tabs/vertical`, `tabs/manual`, `tabs/closable`

